格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Cross-session message bus for DeepSeek Harness: let independent sessions address and wake each other.","id":"gh:1401550484","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-peer-bus","slug":"ybh1291747665/dsh-peer-bus","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Cross-session message bus for DeepSeek Harness: let independent sessions address and wake each other"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ross-session message bus for DeepSeek Harness: let independent sessions address and wake each other."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-peer-bus"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**English** · 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Let two DSH sessions talk to each other."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Restart DSH. If `pnpm` warns about missing peers, ignore it — DSH supplies those from its own runtim"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"start DSH. If `pnpm` warns about missing peers, ignore it — DSH supplies those from its own runtime."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Use"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"You need two sessions. In **each** one, run `/bus id` and copy the id it prints."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"**Let them talk.** A grant means *\"this session may message me\"*, so make it in the session that wil"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"l be **received from**:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Then just ask session A's model, in plain language:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"> Ask `<B's id>` what the release version is."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"It calls `bus_ask`, and B wakes up, answers, and the answer comes back in the same turn. For a one-w"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"ay message, say \"send `<B's id>` a message saying …\". **You never type the tool names yourself** — t"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"he model picks them."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"To allow the other direction too, run `/bus allow <B's id>` in session A."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## What the model gets"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| `bus_send` | send a message; the target wakes up and runs a turn |\n| `bus_ask` | ask a question an"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"d get the answer back in the same turn |\n| `bus_reply` | answer a question explicitly |\n| `bus_wait`"},{"id":"p18s3","text":" | take an incoming message instead of letting it run a turn |\n| `bus_roster` | list the sessions th"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"is one can reach |\n| `bus_status` | what became of a message you sent |\n| `/bus` | **you** grant and"},{"id":"p18s5","text":" revoke permission — no model can |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"**Each message wakes a full turn**, so a turn's worth of context is paid every time. Send several th"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"ings at once with `texts`, correct an instruction the target has not started with `supersede`, and n"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"ote that `steer` batches where `followup` does not — see Spending fewer turns."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Permission"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Nothing is allowed until you grant it. Two ways:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- **`/bus allow <id>`** — one session, one direction, no restart. Durable.\n- **A workspace rule** — "},{"id":"p22s2","text":"every session in one project, in the profile's `cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Messages arrive as *user* messages, and a model treats those as instructions — so an open bus would "},{"id":"p24s2","text":"be a prompt-injection path. Hence default-deny."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Two processes"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Off by default. To reach a session held by another DSH process, set this in **both**:"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"The receiving process still decides permission, so a grant in one process governs that process's ses"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"ng process still decides permission, so a grant in one process governs that process's sessions only."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## More"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"- **USAGE.md** — every tool in detail, all config keys, error codes, troubleshooting\n- **verificatio"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"n/** — what was tested, and what the tests do not prove"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"MIT — see LICENSE."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
